## Why This Is Asked
Regulated multi-tenant data requires per-tenant privacy controls with verifiable audit trails and deterministic replay.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant-scoped redaction
- Deterministic replay via sequence numbers
- Cryptographic receipts and audit roots
- Per-tenant policy evaluation
- Latency implications and backpressure handling

## Code Example
```javascript
function redact(record, policy){
  const out = {...record};
  if(policy.redactEmail) out.email = 'REDACTED';
  if(policy.redactIp) out.ip = 'REDACTED';
  if(policy.redactPhone) out.phone = 'REDACTED';
  // tokenization could be added here
  return out;
}
```

